Package: berry
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: sxhkd
Provides: x-window-manager
Description: healthy, bite-sized window manager
 berry is a small window manager for X11, written in C. Windows are
 managed at runtime through its berryc client; the package ships example
 sxhkd bindings and an autostart script.
